        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no couriers racing through the streets here—every “delivery” happens inside the restaurant. Your goal is to maximize efficiency in a tight space: <strong>Order → Pick up → Serve → Cash in → Expand</strong>. The loop is simple, but every step demands trade-offs, pathing, and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hands-on serving:</strong> weave through tables and crowds, close gaps, and get dishes to the table fast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hiring &amp; coordination:</strong> spawn/upgrade waiters, split roles, and build a high-efficiency “service chain.”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Path optimization:</strong> spend money to unlock tables and corridors, shortening the distance from <strong>Kitchen → Pass → Guest</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rush management:</strong> waves of guests, dish variety, and wait thresholds test your on-the-spot decisions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why You’ll Like It</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light management + real-time action:</strong> plan the numbers and clutch it with footwork—instant gratification.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bright, clean look:</strong> readable, cartoon style that keeps the chaos clear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gradual expansion:</strong> grow from a few tables to a multi-zone restaurant and watch efficiency snowball.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer Note</strong><br>We’re focused on the rhythm and flow of <i>indoor</i> delivery. We’ll keep polishing feel, adding guest/event variety, and expanding content. Tell us what you’d love to see!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no couriers racing through the streets here—every “delivery” happens inside the restaurant. Your goal is to maximize efficiency in a tight space: <strong>Order → Pick up → Serve → Cash in → Expand</strong>. The loop is simple, but every step demands trade-offs, pathing, and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hands-on serving:</strong> weave through tables and crowds, close gaps, and get dishes to the table fast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hiring &amp; coordination:</strong> spawn/upgrade waiters, split roles, and build a high-efficiency “service chain.”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Path optimization:</strong> spend money to unlock tables and corridors, shortening the distance from <strong>Kitchen → Pass → Guest</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rush management:</strong> waves of guests, dish variety, and wait thresholds test your on-the-spot decisions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why You’ll Like It</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light management + real-time action:</strong> plan the numbers and clutch it with footwork—instant gratification.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bright, clean look:</strong> readable, cartoon style that keeps the chaos clear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gradual expansion:</strong> grow from a few tables to a multi-zone restaurant and watch efficiency snowball.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer Note</strong><br>We’re focused on the rhythm and flow of <i>indoor</i> delivery. We’ll keep polishing feel, adding guest/event variety, and expanding content. Tell us what you’d love to see!</p>",
        "short_description": "A fast-paced restaurant management and indoor food-delivery game. Dash around with a tray yourself, hire and coordinate waiters, and during wave after wave of rush hours deliver the right dishes to the right guests via the shortest routes, snowballing tips as you continually expand the restaurant.",
